# PLATFORMER SKELETON
# The form and harmony of a classic 8-bit platformer overworld theme, from memory: a two-bar
# intro; A, a four-bar phrase on I - IV - I - V played four times; B, eight bars twice, its
# second half closing on the borrowed bVI - bVII - I (Ab Bb C) that gives that music its
# lift; C, eight bars rocking between bVI and I and turning back on V; A twice; D, eight bars
# twice on I - IV - V - I. Loops to A. C major, 200 BPM, 24 rows a bar so straight eighths
# (3 rows) and triplets (2 rows) both fit. The bass is by rule - root, root, fifth - and the
# chord stabs on the off-beats are a placeholder for the second voice; no melody, bass line or
# counter-melody of any song is here. Channel 2 (16-bit, in tune everywhere) is empty for the
# tune, and channel 3 is the stabs until you write the second voice over them. The section
# order and the C and D chords are the least certain part: check them against the sheet
# music and move lines in the order list to match.
# Made by Claude, by hand from rules; the tune is yours.
# The format is in Demo1/CLAUDE.md, under "Song files".

song   PLATFORMER SKELETON
key    C MAJOR
rows   24
beat   6

# A square wave for the tune - 16-bit, so every note is within two cents.
instrument SQUARE
  table      wide
  volume     12 11 10 10 9
  distortion tone
  release    2

# Short chord stabs on the off-beats: struck and gone.
instrument STAB
  table      tone
  volume     9 8 6 4 2
  distortion tone
  release    1

# A flat, steady bass, no decay - the pure tone, in tune from C3 up.
instrument FLATBASS
  table      tone
  volume     11 11 10
  distortion tone
  release    1

channel 1 pair LOW BYTE
  note  The low byte of channel 2's 16-bit divider.

channel 2 notes TUNE
  note  Empty: the tune is yours.
  voice SQUARE
  track INTRO    . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track INTRO2   . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track A        . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track A2       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track A3       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track A4       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track B        . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track B2       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track B3       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track B4       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track B5       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track B6       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track B7       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track B8       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track C        . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track C2       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track C3       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track C4       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track C5       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track C6       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track C7       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track C8       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track D        . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track D2       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track D3       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track D4       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track D5       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track D6       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track D7       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .
  track D8       . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .  . . . . . .

channel 3 notes STABS
  note  Off-beat chord stabs - a placeholder for the second voice.
  voice STAB
  track I        . . . . . .  C . . - . .  . . . . . .  C . . - . .
  track V        . . . . . .  G . . - . .  . . . . . .  G . . - . .
  track IV       . . . . . .  F . . - . .  . . . . . .  F . . - . .
  track BVI_BVII . . . . . .  Ab . . - . .  . . . . . .  Bb . . - . .
  track BVI      . . . . . .  Ab . . - . .  . . . . . .  Ab . . - . .

channel 4 notes BASS
  note  Bass: root, root, fifth, on the chords' roots - by rule.
  voice FLATBASS
  track I        C3 . . - . .  . . . C3 . -  G3 . . - . .  G3 . . - . .
  track V        G3 . . - . .  . . . G3 . -  D4 . . - . .  D4 . . - . .
  track IV       F3 . . - . .  . . . F3 . -  C4 . . - . .  C4 . . - . .
  track BVI_BVII Ab3 . . - . .  . . . Eb4 . -  Bb3 . . - . .  . . . F4 . -
  track BVI      Ab3 . . - . .  . . . Ab3 . -  Eb4 . . - . .  Eb4 . . - . .

# The order list: a section at a time.
audctl $50
speed  3
section INTRO
line   .  INTRO    I        I
line   .  INTRO2   V        V
section A
loop
line   .  A        I        I
line   .  A2       IV       IV
line   .  A3       I        I
line   .  A4       V        V
section A
line   .  A        I        I
line   .  A2       IV       IV
line   .  A3       I        I
line   .  A4       V        V
section A
line   .  A        I        I
line   .  A2       IV       IV
line   .  A3       I        I
line   .  A4       V        V
section A
line   .  A        I        I
line   .  A2       IV       IV
line   .  A3       I        I
line   .  A4       V        V
section B
line   .  B        I        I
line   .  B2       IV       IV
line   .  B3       I        I
line   .  B4       V        V
line   .  B5       I        I
line   .  B6       IV       IV
line   .  B7       BVI_BVII BVI_BVII
line   .  B8       I        I
section B
line   .  B        I        I
line   .  B2       IV       IV
line   .  B3       I        I
line   .  B4       V        V
line   .  B5       I        I
line   .  B6       IV       IV
line   .  B7       BVI_BVII BVI_BVII
line   .  B8       I        I
section C
line   .  C        BVI      BVI
line   .  C2       I        I
line   .  C3       BVI      BVI
line   .  C4       I        I
line   .  C5       BVI      BVI
line   .  C6       I        I
line   .  C7       I        I
line   .  C8       V        V
section A
line   .  A        I        I
line   .  A2       IV       IV
line   .  A3       I        I
line   .  A4       V        V
section A
line   .  A        I        I
line   .  A2       IV       IV
line   .  A3       I        I
line   .  A4       V        V
section D
line   .  D        I        I
line   .  D2       IV       IV
line   .  D3       V        V
line   .  D4       I        I
line   .  D5       I        I
line   .  D6       IV       IV
line   .  D7       V        V
line   .  D8       I        I
section D
line   .  D        I        I
line   .  D2       IV       IV
line   .  D3       V        V
line   .  D4       I        I
line   .  D5       I        I
line   .  D6       IV       IV
line   .  D7       V        V
line   .  D8       I        I
